<title>USA: Western Ohio Financial president dies.</title>
<headline>Western Ohio Financial president dies.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ohio 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Ohio Financial Corp said on Monday its president and chief executive officer C. William Clark has died.</p>
<p>Western Ohio Financial Corp is the holding company of Springfield Federal Savings Bank in Springfield, Ohio and Mayflower Federal Savings Bank and Seven Hills Savings Association, both of Cincinnati, Ohio.</p>
<p>The company said its board had taken measures to ensure operations would continue as normal.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
